WEBVTT

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.310
We should be coming up on
the Primal Forest soon.

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:26.270
As I recall, the entrance should be at
the lake near the sacred grounds.

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:27.270
Oh!

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:45.250
Was this place so flowery before?

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.460
Wha--?!

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:52.260
Oh, right. Pegasus is a sacred beast.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:54.920
After all, for small animals,

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:58.300
the space near a sacred beast
is a safe and secure sanctuary.

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:04.180
A small blue rabbit?!

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:06.480
Why that is a pure rabbit!

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:11.320
E-Even I have never encountered one!

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:14.110
It was always at the top of
the in-game cute rankings,

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:16.490
"Cute Rankings"
"1 Pure Rabbit"

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:16.490
and that lovable mascot character is...

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:19.070
...now... right in front of me!

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:24.200
Of course.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:32.880
This is... Could it be that
you spoke to it for me?

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:36.050
Ah, you are so good!

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:41.140
You are such a demanding little thing.

00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:44.270
There, there. You are a good little bunny.

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:52.940
What did you say to it this time?

00:01:54.530 --> 00:02:00.620
Now, then, I cannot keep playing
with animals here forever.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:03.160
I am on an errand for Solomon,

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:06.540
and I must now go find seeds
of the progenitors.

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:09.250
This is goodbye to you all.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:13.290
Pegasus, good work.
I will call on you again.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:30.560
What is this? Do you all think
of me as Pegasus's boss?

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:36.780
No, no. If anything,
where I am going is full of danger.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.950
Do not follow me.

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:48.040
Then you leave me no choice.
Let me get a negotiator.

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:56.630
"Evocation: Cat-Sith"

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:04.890
I was summoned and I pop out! Meow-meow!

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:07.560
"Excited"

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:07.560
I tried making my appearance
a bit more elaborate, meow.

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:10.100
"Excited"

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:10.100
How would you score it,
Party Leader?

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:13.610
"Excited"

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:13.610
Six points, I would say. Your tail
was ever so slightly quivery.

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:15.400
"Crushed"

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:15.400
Meow did you say?!

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:17.900
"Work, work, work"

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:17.900
So, what can I do for you this time?

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:20.030
Mm, I want you to tell these animals

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:23.820
not to follow me,
because it will be dangerous.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:25.660
Meow, yes, sir!

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:31.790
Mission accomplished, meow.

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:33.170
Mm, good work.

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:35.420
Party Leader, I'll accompany you, meow.

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:37.590
All right. Come along then.

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:39.510
Meow, yes, sir!

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:17.480
"Episode 10
'I Get Naked!'"

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:20.690
Cat Search Light, meow!

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:22.150
Ah!

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:31.490
That looks suspicious, meow.

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:35.250
"Devils' Labyrinth
Primal Forest
Adventurers' Union"

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:35.250
Mm, so that would be the barrier.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:38.080
This is where the pass comes into play.

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:49.470
So, now I am granted passage.

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:58.020
Party Leader, we've finally discovered
an unexplored area, meow!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.350
Meow-hoo!

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:01.190
I appreciate everything you have done.

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.020
Me-meow?!

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:04.780
"Meoweize! That is too khuruul, meow!"

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:11.910
"Meoweize! Please!
That is too khuruul, meow!
That is too cruel"

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:15.040
Unseen adventures still await, meow!

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:17.290
You are a hopeless one.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:21.500
"Wholehearted sincerity"

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:21.500
That's my Party Leader!
I'll stalk you for life, meow!

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:24.550
"Wholehearted sincerity"

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:24.550
Is that not where you
should say, "I will follow you"?

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:27.970
Now, shall we go?

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:31.220
It's pitch black ahead, meow.

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:33.350
Cat Search Light, yet again!

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:37.060
This part always gets my blood pumping!

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:37.930
Onwards!

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:40.690
The adventure begins, meow!

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:50.200
Party Leader, I'm gonna wet myself, meow!

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:51.490
Hold it in!

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:55.870
Meow! Meow, meow, meow! Me-meow!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.790
Ugh-meow.

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:03.210
Oh, my apologies. Are you all right?

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:04.590
"Letting a woman throw
her weight around is part
of being a good man!"

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.010
A new world, meow!

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:14.390
We've discovered a new world in the
depths of the unexplored area, meow!

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:17.100
"Cat-Sith Expedition"

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:17.100
We've discovered a new world in the
depths of the unexplored area, meow!

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:22.730
Now, how many will I be able to find?

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:28.320
Party Leader, please be careful, meow.

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:29.570
Meow!

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:30.950
Meow!

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.450
"10.0 Yet Again"

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:34.120
Party Leader!

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:38.410
Hang on!

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:41.290
Let's do this!

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:46.630
That was a close call, Party Leader, meow.

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:48.300
For you, yes.

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:59.890
At long last, one.

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:02.640
Party Leader, how many more
do you need, meow?

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:06.860
That would be nine.
This is going to be truly arduous.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:10.690
A dog won't work, meow.
It's oink time, meow!

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.610
Oink, oink, oink. Oink, oink, oink.

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:14.320
Party Leader, this way, meow.

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:16.120
What are you, a truffle hog?!

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:18.740
Or rather, where is your pride as a cat?!

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:33.680
Good, good. Just half to go now.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:33.930
--Oink, oink, oink. Oink, oink, oink.

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.390
--It looks like we may finish
earlier than planned.
--Oink, oink, oink. Oink, oink, oink.

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:37.640
Oink!

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:39.060
Danger, meow!

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:44.480
So, they have appeared.

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:46.860
Meow!

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:48.940
Lay low for a bit.

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:50.190
Roger that, meow.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:53.820
Oh, hey! Do not stiffen
your tail! That tickles!

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:11.300
Immortal Arts, Earth: Crimson Bouquet!

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:13.050
"Immortal Arts, Earth:
Crimson Bouquet"

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:24.520
Partial summons of the
dark knight's great sword

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:26.600
and the holy knight's shield.

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:28.020
Quite the feat, eh?

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:30.320
I'd expect no less of you,
Party Leader, meow.

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:34.440
Got it, meow!

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:37.820
So, you can collect loot as well?

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:40.740
Now, I'll look for the next one, meow!

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:43.580
That makes ten.

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:47.830
"Mission complete!"

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:47.830
We got what we came for, so I
think it is time to head home.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.250
"And now, to return!"

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.250
Yes, meow.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.540
"And now, to return!"

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.540
As I recall, when I came here last time,

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:55.670
the area with blue flowers
led to the exit.

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:58.800
Party Member 1, do you see them anywhere?

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:02.600
Found them, meow!

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:03.810
Well done!

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:06.850
Follow this path and we find the exit.

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:13.860
Meow! Party Leader, treasure, meow!

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:16.150
"Ancient box hidden in
the unexplored area, will it
prove to be hope or despair?!"

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:16.150
Mm, that is a treasure chest.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:18.360
"Ancient box hidden in
the unexplored area, will it
prove to be hope or despair?!"

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:18.360
Tempting.

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:19.910
"Ancient box hidden in
the unexplored area, will it
prove to be hope or despair?!"

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:19.910
Hmm, as I recall,

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:24.290
the Guild Union leader
of Karanak spoke of this.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:28.160
This place was deemed a specially
designated forbidden area

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:31.000
because the treasure kept
respawning over and over,

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:35.010
and the fighting over it
became intolerable.

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:39.380
Immortal Arts, Heaven: Shock Wave!

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:41.390
"Immortal Arts, Heaven:
Shock Wave"

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:45.310
That was savage, Party Leader, meow.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:49.310
Will the contents of the treasure chest
be monsters or treasure?

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:52.650
To determine that, allow me,
your humble servant, meow.

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.360
No problem here, meow!

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:58.900
I had no idea you could even do that now.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:02.160
"Ever-evolving!"

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:02.160
The result of 30 years of training, meow!

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.000
Me-me-meow?

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:12.210
This looks like a piece of
the World Tree, meow!

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:14.420
A piece of the World Tree, eh?

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.920
Sounds like something
Luminaria would want.

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:30.140
How rare to see a human in these parts.

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:33.150
Looking for something?

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:35.150
It talked, meow!

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:37.190
We wish to exit this place.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:42.030
I see, I see. Then,
I think I can help you.

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:46.700
Bring me the source of strength
and I shall deliver you to the surface.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:50.040
Ah! You already have it.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.670
You must mean this.

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:54.330
Throw it into the lake.

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:57.300
Do so, and I shall escort you to the exit.

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:02.970
Your contribution is confirmed.
Then, here we go.

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:05.890
Meow's going on, meow?!

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:10.520
No need to worry. We are merely
being taken to the exit.

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:12.690
Meow! Me-me-meow!

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:14.560
Stop that! It is shifting!

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:32.580
Ugh-meow.

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:35.210
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:37.630
Handle us with a little more care!

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:39.920
Slip down that river
and you will emerge outside.

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:42.300
Fare thee well, o rare visitor.

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:44.510
That flower marches to its own beat, meow.

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:46.890
Well, it is a flower, after all.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:54.560
Now, all that remains is to go downstream.

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:00.320
Then, here we go, Party Member 1.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:02.440
To the ends of the earth, meow!

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:08.240
M-Meow!

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:11.200
We're sliding down, meow!
It's so slippery, meow!

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:12.660
Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow!

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:17.960
Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow! Meow! Meow!

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:19.670
"Gravitational acceleration
is 9.80665m/s^2"

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:32.470
Here, a towel.

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:33.520
Meow!

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:48.660
Who is there?

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:53.950
You're... not a spirit?

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:55.580
A spirit, you say?

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:58.830
Meow are you saying, meow?!
Party Leader is Party Leader, meow!

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:00.750
Is that a cat-sith?

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:03.710
Mm, for I am a summoner.

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:07.880
That's right, meow! Party Leader is a
very, very powerful summoner, meow!

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:10.640
You will show respect, meow!

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:12.350
I see.

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:15.930
You looked as beautiful as a spirit,
so I mistook you for one.

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:18.480
Ah, is that so?

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:22.110
However, if you mistook me for a spirit,

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:24.650
it makes me wonder all the more.
Why were you so wary?

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:26.110
Oh, well, you know,

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:30.160
I once wandered into the territory
of a slightly irate spirit,

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:32.870
and found myself
getting chased around, so...

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:35.370
That was really rough.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:39.290
Mm, is that so? Then,
I suppose it cannot be helped.

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.880
What a foolish guy, meow.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.840
You keep quiet for a bit.

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:45.340
Yes, meow.

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:50.090
Spirits are free.
They do not have territories.

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:53.510
So, what were you doing here just now?

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:56.980
Collecting some herbs
and nuts and berries.

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:59.850
Oh, yeah. I was about to
head back to my village.

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:01.100
Bye now.

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:08.280
It looks like I had better
investigate this.

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:15.290
Go hide for a while.

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:17.000
Understood, meow.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:29.130
"There's no one here, meow."

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:07.670
You must be Chimera Clausen.
We've got a lot of questions for you.

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:11.590
Isuzu League? You've gone to a lot of
trouble coming all the way out here.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:17.390
Shikigami Talismanic Arts, Mizuchi!

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:25.810
"Shikigami Talismanic Arts, Mizuchi"

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:42.040
An earth elemental vial!

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:48.500
I had heard that the Isuzu League
has a lot of diviners.

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:54.590
Celestial Talismanic Arts, Third Rite
of Wood, Soul of Eight Trigrams!

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:55.840
"Celestial Talismanic Arts, Third Rite
of Wood, Soul of Eight Trigrams"

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:04.440
That is a spell that makes your
opponent feel the same pain as you.

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:07.480
Celestial Talismanic Arts, Third Rite
of Water, Twin Reflecting Water!

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:10.280
Wh-What the--?

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:12.650
The mizuchi's <i>shikigami </i>talisman!

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:16.870
Wha...?

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:19.280
He seems to have managed to capture him.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:27.670
This is...

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:29.750
...an anesthetic poison...

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:33.010
Correct.

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:39.140
I'll end this quickly.

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:43.810
What... the hell?!

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:50.020
You're...

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:55.820
Wait here a moment.

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.630
I thought you were a summoner.

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:13.960
What the hell are you doing here?

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:16.760
What of you? What were you doing here?

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:19.010
I believe you said you were
returning to your village.

00:18:19.010 --> 00:18:21.100
I just got a little lost.

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:23.850
Whatever the case,
your actions are not tranquil.

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:26.600
What say you tell me
something of your story?

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:31.270
There's nothing worth telling.
And besides, there's no need to tell you.

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:41.490
Oh-ho, it seems he even knows how
to fight an immortal arts practitioner,

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:44.830
who has full command
of special movement spells.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:52.540
Wha--?

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:58.720
No choice. I'll use this!

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:10.770
This should...

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:14.230
...let me regain freedom of
movement before anyone else.

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:23.030
Why you...

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:24.950
What did you do?

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:28.250
Immortal Arts: Paralyzing Demon's Gaze.

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.620
I have you fully spellbound.

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:33.540
Why?

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:35.880
Why can you move?

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:38.760
The immobilizing effect of my
lightning elemental paralysis vial

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:42.590
should definitely have...
caught you... as well...

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:45.430
Because I have this.

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:48.430
I have full resistance
to all status effects.

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:54.810
Fairy's Grace, huh?
You've got to be... kidding me...

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:58.570
I don't know who you are,
but you saved me.

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:02.160
Thank you.

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:03.490
Do not pay it any mind.

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:08.660
This Chimera Clausen entity
is an enemy of mine as well.

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:11.540
Who is that? A friend of yours?

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.170
Yes, a friend.

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:16.540
I belong to the Isuzu League.
My name is Blue.

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:18.210
Likewise, I'm White.

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:19.920
I am Mira.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.300
This is your cat-sith, right?

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:23.930
Party Leader!

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:27.260
It's okay, meow.
She's not a bad person, meow.

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:31.810
What is this? You had come along, too?

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:35.900
So, what shall we do with him?

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:38.270
If you don't mind, would you
let us take charge of him?

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:41.740
We want to take him back to
our base nearby for questioning.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:43.450
I see.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:47.160
That reminds me,
on the way back from Karanak...

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:48.990
Were you attacked by humans?

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:52.040
Yes, suddenly on the lakeshore.

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:54.960
In my surprise, I was
fleeing through the grove,

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:58.880
when Nyanmaru drove away the scary people.

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:00.260
Nyanmaru?

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:04.970
Do you know this Nyanmaru's master?

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:08.930
No, I've never met them before.

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:12.140
That <i>shikigami</i>'s name was Nyanmaru.

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:14.850
Nyanmaru?

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:16.980
Does that ring a bell?

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:19.940
If we're talking an expert diviner
with a terrible taste in names,

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:22.070
who uses <i>shikigami</i>...

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:26.610
One of the Nine Wise Men,
the Elder of the Tower of Divination,

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:28.370
Kagura of the Seven Stars.

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:31.700
Chimera Clausen is an armed
group that captures spirits

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:35.080
and the Isuzu League is
an organization that opposes them.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:38.040
The <i>shikigami</i>, Nyanmaru,
who protects spirits.

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:41.420
The latter two may be related in some way.

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:43.210
Base, eh?

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:46.340
In that case, might I ask
to be taken there as well?

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:51.770
What? Well, personally,
you saved my life, so I'd love to,

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:53.730
but unfortunately, I'm junior in rank.

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:57.900
Still, I'll do everything I can to talk
to our leader on your behalf.

00:21:57.900 --> 00:22:00.480
Though, I can't make any promises.

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:02.820
Mm, that is fine.

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:10.330
Wrapping him in this allows us to
suppress his powers to one-tenth.

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:11.530
Ah.

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:13.080
Then, let's go.

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:15.120
Mm.

00:22:15.120 --> 00:22:18.750
Now, I wonder what I will learn...
